      "p_a_canonical": 0.9948244971746025,
      "prose": {
        "text": "I hold the position of **Fully remote**.\n\nHere's one reason:\n\n\"Fully remote\" because it allows for increased flexibility and work-life balance, which can lead to improved employee satisfaction and productivity.",
